Where is parking hardest in Frankfurt? (frankfurt-parking-hardest), version 2
=============================================================================

The scripts in this folder are under this repository's Apache-2.0 licence.
The data the template carries is not: each dataset stays under its own
source's terms, below.

Sources, licences and credits, as the template's facts and its map's note
carry them:

- start2park Park-and-Visit trips, ReLUT, Frankfurt University of Applied Sciences, BSD-3-Clause: ReLUT, Frankfurt University of Applied Sciences
- Georeferenced street parking locations in Frankfurt am Main, Frankfurt University of Applied Sciences, ODbL-1.0: © OpenStreetMap contributors

The build reads both sources through ../frankfurt-parking/sources.mjs, at
the same pinned addresses as the map "Hunting for a parking spot in
Frankfurt".


start2park Park-and-Visit trips
-------------------------------

Dataset: search_points (the 1,147 waypoints marked as searching on the
trips that end in Frankfurt, November 2020 to June 2021: 65 trips with a
search, 131.4 minutes of searching)

Publisher: ReLUT, the Research Lab for Urban Transport at Frankfurt
University of Applied Sciences, from the start2park project.
https://github.com/ReLUT/parking-search-prediction/tree/main/Park-and-Visit

Licence: BSD 3-Clause License, as the repository's LICENSE states at the
pinned commit. Its notice (the copyright line, the three conditions and
the disclaimer) is reproduced word for word at the end of this file and
in a note on the workflow's canvas.

Credit: ReLUT, Frankfurt University of Applied Sciences.

Where and when: read on 2026-10-12 at 11:40:37 UTC from the publisher's
repository at commit de394ee98e37612da887b0e5cd9c87f8adf6a106:

  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ReLUT/parking-search-prediction/de394ee98e37612da887b0e5cd9c87f8adf6a106/Park-and-Visit/Dynamic_Park-and-visit_waypoints.csv
  (1,346,641 bytes, SHA-256 b50ff1b2faa3e158a2ed07835c0e3ef43d7f5127ed7e1faba44a7224d033fa04)
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ReLUT/parking-search-prediction/de394ee98e37612da887b0e5cd9c87f8adf6a106/Park-and-Visit/Dynamic_Park-and-visit_metadata.csv
  (16,944 bytes, SHA-256 8ad4e6f562855f51a442d1c934567eccd989f449437a11141e3ce73201eaff24)
