minutes until the trip's next waypoint. Nothing else of the waypoints is
kept.


Georeferenced street parking locations in Frankfurt am Main
-----------------------------------------------------------

Dataset: parking_spaces (29,215 parking spaces, one point each)

Publisher: Frankfurt University of Applied Sciences, on the Mobilithek,
offer 886571101635461120 ("Georeferenzierte Straßenparkstandorte in
Frankfurt am Main / Georeferenced street parking locations in Frankfurt am
Main"; temporal coverage 2024-01-01 to 2025-03-31).
https://mobilithek.info/offers/886571101635461120

Licence: Open Database License v1.0 (ODbL-1.0), the offer's standard
licence. The offer's condition for use: "This dataset contains information
from OpenStreetMap, which is made available here
(https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright) under the Open Database License
(ODbL)." The data was processed from OpenStreetMap with the OSM Parkraum
processing (https://github.com/osmberlin/osm-parking-processing, AGPL-3.0,
a licence of that code, not of the data).
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Credit: © OpenStreetMap contributors.

Where and when: read on 2026-10-12 at 11:40:37 UTC from the offer's one
file (fetched with curl, which verifies the server's certificate):

  https://mobilithek.info/mdp-api/files/aux/886571101635461120/FFM_parking_data.zip
