The workflow's results
----------------------

The template carries each workflow step's result from its run on
2026-10-12 (results/<step id>.parquet): the searching minutes and the
parking spaces per H3 cell, the minutes per space, and the hot spot
scores. They are made from both sources together and carry both sources'
terms: the BSD-3-Clause notice of the trips and the ODbL of the spaces.


